Sorry, but I have to reopen this issue, since your fix broke injecting of static fields in enums. See the example:

public class Issue295 {
  @ lombok.Log
  public enum AnEnum {
    A,
    B;
  }

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    AnEnum keks = AnEnum.A;
  }
