Is translated by Delombok to:

public AbstractField(FieldParameter parameter, JsonSchema jsonSchema) {
    try {
        super();
        {{rest of constructor}}
    } catch (final UnknownCustomTypeException $ex) {
        throw lombok.Lombok.sneakyThrow($ex);
