With

```
public class Book {
    private BookDetail bookDetail;
}

public class BookDetail {
    private Book book;
}
```

you've created a cyclic structure. Generated methods like `equals`, `hashCode` and `toString` can't deal with it... and there's no unique way how they could. They could detect cycles, but this would cost time even for non-cyclic structures. You can `exclude` a field manually instead.

