It would be really nice if it were possible to aggregate several of lombok's annotations into custom ones, then allow it to be used on code. For example, today I have several classes like this:


```java

@Data
@Wither
@FieldDefaults(level = AccessLevel.PRIVATE)
@AllArgsConstructor
@NoArgsConstructor
public class MyPojo {

	String fieldOne;
        String fieldTwo;
        String fieldThree;

}
