Is there a way of weaving methods in Lombok? (_Traits...?_) (_Mixins...?_)

Why do I ask under this issue at all:
Because I have a method called `toJson()`.
The implementation is something like this:
```
protected String toJson() {
	return new ObjectMapper().writeValueAsString(this);
}
```
Now, the only way to have it in my classes of interest - is to inherit from some class implementing it.
And this is ugly. Not a Lombok way!!! Lombok does Object. ;)
So, instead, I would prefer a way to weave this implementation into classes of interest.

**Finally**, I'd like to use it as a `toString()` replacement.
For that I would do something like `@ToString(delegate=toJson)` - which should result in something like:
```
