        value1 = 0;
        value2 = (v1 == null ? 0 : v1) + (v2 == null ? 0 : v2);
    }
}

@RequiredArgsConstructor
class Child2 extends Parent2 {
    @NonNull private String str;
}
```

Does Child2 have one or two constructors?  If one, which?  If two, what if I knew I only wanted to expose one of them from the child?

