Right now a Builder only accepts the actual values to populate the object with.
However for hierarchical objects I would like to have a builder that is able to tweak the whole hierarchy.
Such a builder could be instantiated with a certain base structure, but has ways to change values somewhere down the tree before building.

Suppose we have classes like these:
```java
@Builder
