**Describe the bug**
When you have:
```java
@Getter
@FieldNameConstants
public class A {
  private String fieldA;
}
```
and:
```java
@Getter
@FieldNameConstants
public class B extends A {
  private String fieldB;
}
```
then you can access both fields like this:
```
B b = new B():
b.getFieldA();
b.getFieldB()
