It would be nice if there would be a possibility to generate override methods that replace the self return type of the superclass. That way boilerplate code for creating fluent methods with inheritance would be reduced without using ugly [self bounding generics](http://makble.com/java-generics-selfbounding)

Example:
```
class Foo {
    @SelfLift  //mark method as 'self liftable'
    public Foo method() {
        return this;
    }
}

@SelfLift  //ask lombok to generate lifted methods
class Bar extends Foo {}
