This code:
```
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class LazyGetterBugExample {

  String value;

  @Getter(lazy = true)
  int valueLength = value.length();

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    System.out.println(
        new LazyGetterBugExample("Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet")
            .getValueLength());
  }
