which seems to be fixed by
```
--- a/src/core/lombok/javac/handlers/HandleGetter.java
+++ b/src/core/lombok/javac/handlers/HandleGetter.java
@@ -463,6 +463,6 @@ public class HandleGetter extends JavacAnnotationHandler<Getter> {
        }
        
        public JCExpression copyType(JavacTreeMaker treeMaker, JCVariableDecl fieldNode) {
-               return fieldNode.type != null ? treeMaker.Type(fieldNode.type) : fieldNode.vartype;
+               return fieldNode.type != null ? treeMaker.Type(fieldNode.type) : cloneType(treeMaker, fieldNode.vartype, null);
        }
 }
```
(although I'm sure that this one isn't the best fix; at the very least we should pass something better than `null`)

