**Describe the feature**

Add new annotations for converting Java objects. For example: @ConvertTo({FooA.class, FooB.class}).

Currently developers usually use Mapstruct, BeanUtils or handwriting when converting objects. However, 

- BeanUtils has performance losses

- MapStruct is difficult to use，adds extra coding work

- handwriting can be very annoying

If lombok add this annotation to lombok, it will greatly improve the development efficiency of application developers, improve application performance, and avoid annoying handwritten getters and setters.

***Before***
