```java
@Retention(RUNTIME)
@Value("#{jobParameters[inputFilePath]}")
public @interface InputFilePath {}

@Service
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class MyService {

    @InputFilePath
    private final Path inputFilePath;
}
```

But when combined with `@RequiredArgsConstructor`, I will need to add each of those meta-annotations in my lombok.config (copyableAnnotations).

I see different solutions:

1. Allow wildcard in lombok.config (lombok.copyableAnnotations += com.example.*)
2. Annotate the meta-annotation with `@CopyableAnnotation` to let lombok know it should be copied on the constructor's parameter
3. If an annotation is annotated with a copyable annotation, it should be copyable too (this should work on multiple levels of annotations)

